// hr_c20: Hive City remaster, the red neon shop street (camera c20).
// No ReflectScale anywhere (the owner: floors were too reflective). smoothness scales the _gloss map.
// pxmat (2026-11-24): + ReliefScale (parallax, textures/<name>_hmap), ReflectScale on metal/glass/lamps (floors stay dry), detailmap.
